{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:4GLib11getHostNameSSSgyF","modules":[{"name":"GLib"}],"roleHeading":"Function","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"getHostName"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"text":"!","kind":"text"}],"symbolKind":"func","title":"getHostName()"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/getHostName()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"getHostName","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"!"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The returned name is not necessarily a fully-qualified domain name,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"or even present in DNS or some other name service at all. It need","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"not even be unique on your local network or site, but usually it","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"is. Callers should not rely on the return value having any specific","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"properties like uniqueness for security purposes. Even if the name"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the machine is changed while an application is running, the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"return value from this function does not change. The returned","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"string is owned by GLib and should not be modified or freed. If no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"